  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "deal massive true damage to the highest cumulative damage dealer",
    "skill1": "dash behind highest damage dealer, dealing damage to target and enemies in path",
    "skill2": "deal damage to adjacent enemies and self-heal",
    "skill3": "battle crit increase",
    "skill4": "consecutive dashes trigger additional area slashes",
    "skill5": "charge and slashes also reduce enemy shield values"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Athalia]] dives behind the highest damage dealer, slashing foes in her path while healing herself. Her ultimate deals **massive true damage** to the enemy with the most cumulative damage. Repeated dashes trigger extra area slashes that also strip enemy shields. She excels at bursting isolated carries and forcing defensive formation choices. She offers less value when fights demand sustained pressure or when her target is protected from the opening dive.",
  "counter_overview": "In PVP, [[Athalia]] dives behind your highest damage dealer and delivers true damage tied to that unit's output. Shield or spread the threatened backline early, then race her with [[filter:energy-provider]] like [[Thador]] or [[Hugin]]. Peel the target with [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Evie]] or [[Bonnie]] instead of feeding her a clean kill. She relocates too often for assassin pins, so lasting coverage like [[Shemira]] or [[Frieren]] keeps pressure wherever she lands."
}
